592186335910 #edb/ref 1071 "Solve for $m$ where ${5}^{m-10}={125}^{m}.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186335910 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "4e3e80cb-8e1b-5722-8654-94f1e02c6077" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186335910 #edb/ref 1074 "To solve this equation, we need both exponential terms to have a common base.\n\nTo do this, we write $125$ as ${5}^{3},$ and then rewrite the right-hand side using the power rule of exponents:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{5}^{m-10} & ={125}^{m} \\\\ {5}^{m-10} & ={({5}^{3})}^{m} \\\\ {5}^{m-10} & ={5}^{3m}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since both sides of the equation share the same base $(5)$, we equate the exponents and solve for $m:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m-10 & =3m \\\\ -2m & =10 \\\\ m & =-5\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186410210 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{5}{3}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186410210 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186410210 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "083bbb43-125e-530a-a0bf-4e386e0fef8e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186410238 #edb/ref 1080 "-\\frac{2}{5}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186410238 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186410238 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "2ebed13b-65b6-5f09-b6ac-5843bb401594" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186410289 #edb/ref 1080 "5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186410289 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186410289 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "8a7cd739-dad9-5004-a078-dfdfdfb9ad48" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186410335 #edb/ref 1080 "\\frac{3}{5}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186410335 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186410335 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c45e66f0-50f2-598c-b5d0-5402c3cbc44b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186410357 #edb/ref 1080 "3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186410357 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186410357 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "e52fbbd7-076f-5ca8-a202-557210987158" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [1759218